0 Fixture: two 2x2 round tiles on the outer corners of a 2x8 plate.
0 Expected: clean. Proves the 14769 underside annotation.
0
0 These are the seed drone's eyes. LDraw draws this tile's underside as a
0 single round holder and emits only its bore, dead centre -- and nothing
0 ever sits at the centre of a 2x2 footprint, so the tile read as a part
0 that could not clutch to anything. The holder really grips the four
0 studs around it, which is what the annotation says, and it is the same
0 correction already made for 15535 next door in connections.yml.
0
0 Four studs, not one, is also why the eyes sit square on the face plate
0 instead of being free to spin.
0
0 !LDRCHECK FRONT +Z
0 !LDRCHECK JOINS 14769.dat 3738.dat
1 10 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3738.dat
1 15 -60 -8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 14769.dat
1 15 60 -8 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 14769.dat
